dec":"h264"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/720x900/me4YjdyRTpfDlUBg.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":2176000,"container":"mp4","codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/1080x1350/-Sy3o0FwcVsFIaAz.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":10368000,"container":"mp4","codec":"h264"}],"publisher":null,"variants":[{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/pl/NVPznDfLctrmWriU.m3u8?tag=29","bitrate":0,"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/320x400/hxCOxeMbnMQ4iECi.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":632000,"content_type":"video/mp4"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/480x600/Qb10elZCWI25Dz1O.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":950000,"content_type":"video/mp4"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/720x900/me4YjdyRTpfDlUBg.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":2176000,"content_type":"video/mp4"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2098040647450304512/vid/avc1/1080x1350/-Sy3o0FwcVsFIaAz.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":10368000,"content_type":"video/mp4"}]}]},"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/Kuvvius/status/2083236309414683066","id":"2083236309414683066","text":"Robotics felt different this month. Google DeepMind and Anthropic made the same question hard to ignore: can a reasoning model decide what a whole body/robot should do next?\n\nGemini Robotics 2 put an embodied reasoning model above a VLA for whole-body control. Anthropic tested general-purpose reasoning models at several levels of control.\n\n- https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-brings-whole-body-intelligence-to-robots/\n- https://anthropic.com/research/claude-plays-robotics\n\nThe bad news is clear. General-purpose reasoning models still cannot control a humanoid on their own. They need a pretrained policy underneath.\n\nStill, I think this might actually work. A strong model (w/ excellent multimodal and reasoning capabilities) could really do it one day.\n\nHumanCLAW is our attempt to get an early glimpse of that future.","raw_text":{"text":"Robotics felt different this month. Google DeepMind and Anthropic made the same question hard to ignore: can a reasoning model decide what a whole body/robot should do next?\n\nGemini Robotics 2 put an embodied reasoning model above a VLA for whole-body control. Anthropic tested general-purpose reasoning models at several levels of control.\n\n- https://t.co/2jQQp1HjyE\n- https://t.co/ed0wZcIaRO\n\nThe bad news is clear. General-purpose reasoning models still cannot control a humanoid on their own. They need a pretrained policy underneath.\n\nStill, I think this might actually work. A strong model (w/ excellent multimodal and reasoning capabilities) could really do it one day.\n\nHumanCLAW is our attempt to get an early glimpse of that future.","display_text_range":[0,742],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[105,173]},{"type":"media","indices":[278,301],"id":"2083235518188556288","display":"pic.x.com/NB1QSe2D5O","original":"https://t.co/NB1QSe2D5O","replacement":"https://x.com/Kuvvius/status/2083236309414683066/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[344,367],"original":"https://t.co/2jQQp1HjyE","replacement":"https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-brings-whole-body-intelligence-to-robots/","display":"deepmind.google/blog/gemini-ro…"},{"type":"url","indices":[370,393],"original":"https://t.co/ed0wZcIaRO","replacement":"https://anthropic.com/research/claude-plays-robotics","display":"anthropic.com/research/claud…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Kuvvius","url":"https://x.com/Kuvvius","id":"1635560727284191232","followers":609,"following":345,"likes":262,"media_count":78,"name":"Jiawei Gu","description":"","raw_description":{"text":"","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1635560727284191232/1762432134","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046841522637922304/td5r5aEP_200x200.jpg","joi